# TallyImporter — Agent Rules

- Test-first. Write/adjust the failing test before implementation.
- Money is `Decimal`. A `float` in any money path is a defect.
- All boundary models are `frozen=True, extra="forbid"`. Inputs validate or raise
  typed errors — never silently coerce.
- Output must be deterministic and byte-stable; no time/random/unordered iteration
  in output.
- Stages never import each other; depend only on `contracts/` and `core/`.
- Build XML only via `lxml`; never concatenate strings into XML.
- The Tally XML contract is fixed by §2 of `PHASE_1_BUILD.md`; do not add or rename
  tags without a doc reference.
- Every task ends with `make check` green. Do not proceed on a red gate.
